{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T18:19:25.092Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## ip/dns **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/dns \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/dns/static **Type:** Directory":"## ip/dns/static \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/address-list **Type:** Directory":"## ip/firewall/address-list \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/calea **Type:** Directory":"## ip/firewall/calea \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/connection **Type:** Directory":"## ip/firewall/connection \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/connection/tracking **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/firewall/connection/tracking \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/filter/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ip/firewall/filter/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/firewall/filter/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ip/firewall/filter/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000Answers the router can give from its cache: upstream answers and the static entries. For a complete list, including the PTR records made for static entries, see [`all`](LINK). For an overview, see [DNS](LINK).":"路由器可以从其缓存中给出的应答：上游应答和静态条目。完整列表（包括为静态条目生成的 PTR 记录）请参阅 [`all`](/docs/7.25/cli-reference/ip/dns/cache/all)。概览请参阅 [DNS](/docs/network-management/dns)。","docs-7.25\u0000Settings of the DNS resolver and cache. The router uses them for its own lookups and, with `allow-remote-requests=yes`, answers DNS queries from clients. A change in this menu takes effect at once; a query that arrives at that moment can stay unanswered, and the client sends it again. The cache is kept. For an overview and examples, see [DNS](LINK).":"DNS 解析器和缓存的设置。路由器将其用于自身的查询，并在 `allow-remote-requests=yes` 时应答来自客户端的 DNS 查询。此菜单中的更改会立即生效；此时到达的查询可能得不到应答，客户端会重新发送该查询。缓存会保留。有关概述和示例，请参阅 [DNS](/docs/network-management/dns)。","docs-7.25\u0000Static DNS entries. The router answers queries for these names itself, without asking an upstream server, and applies them also to the targets of CNAME answers from upstream. For a name with a static entry, queries for other record types go to the upstream server, and the router passes the answer on; when the upstream server has no such record, the router answers NOERROR with no records. Create only one entry that matches a given name and record type: when several entries match, the list order does not decide which one answers. For examples, see [DNS](LINK).":"静态 DNS 条目。路由器会自行应答这些名称的查询，不询问上游服务器，并且也会将这些条目应用于上游 CNAME 应答的目标。对于具有静态条目的名称，其他记录类型的查询会发送到上游服务器，路由器会转发应答；当上游服务器没有此类记录时，路由器会应答 NOERROR 且不携带任何记录。对于给定名称和记录类型，仅创建一个匹配的条目：当多个条目匹配时，列表顺序不会决定由哪个条目应答。示例请参阅 [DNS](/docs/7.25/network-management/dns)。"}}
